<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;SERIES POWER STORAGE DUAL VOLTAGE POWER SUPPLY DEVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device is a revolutionary creation designed to provide a stable and efficient power supply, combining two voltage power supplies in a single unit for unparalleled flexibility and reliability."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US 11142091&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PATENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"US 11142091 is a patent granted to the inventors of the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device, representing years of research, experimentation, and perseverance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NOVATECH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"NovaTech is a company known for producing the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device, with a logo emblazoned on the device's sleek metal casing."&lt;SEP&gt;"NovaTech is an organization behind a device that Rizwan suspects is linked to recent mysterious events at the port."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RIZWAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rizwan is a character who feels there is more to the job and suspects a connection between the NovaTech device and recent events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rizwan is a seasoned shipbreaker with a reputation for being one of the best in the business, hired to dismantle the MV Serenity and salvage its components."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MV SERENITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MV Serenity is a retired cargo vessel slated for demolition, its valuable components to be salvaged and recycled."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHITTAGONG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chittagong is a bustling port in Bangladesh where the events of the second document take place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECLUSIVE BILLIONAIRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A reclusive billionaire with a penchant for cutting-edge technology, who requested the installation of a specialized power supply device on the MV Serenity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SALTWATER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Saltwater is the smell associated with the port of Chittagong, indicating the maritime environment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GREASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Grease is part of the smell associated with the port of Chittagong, indicating the industrial and mechanical nature of the area."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MACHINE HUM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The distant hum of machinery is mentioned, indicating the industrial activity in the port."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SHIPBREAKING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Shipbreaking is the process of dismantling ships, which is Rizwan's profession."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PORT OPERATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Port Operations include the activities and processes taking place in the port of Chittagong."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUAL VOLTAGE OUTPUTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dual Voltage Outputs refer to the capability of the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device to handle two voltage levels."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POWER SUPPLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Power Supply is the function of providing electricity to various systems and devices."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRITICAL SYSTEMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Critical Systems are those that require a stable and reliable power supply to remain operational."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POWER OUTAGES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Power Outages are common issues that the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device aims to mitigate."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VOLTAGE FLUCTUATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Voltage Fluctuations are another issue that the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device addresses."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEGAL FILING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A legal filing was lodged against the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device, alleging infringement of existing patents."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PATENT INFRINGEMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Patent Infringement is the allegation made in the legal filing against the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXPERT TESTIMONY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Expert Testimony was presented during the legal proceedings to support the validity of the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMPIRICAL DATA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Empirical Data was used to support the validity of the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device during the legal proceedings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Legal Proceedings were held to determine the validity of the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device and the allegations of patent infringement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CATALYST FOR ADOPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The legal filing served as a catalyst for the widespread adoption of the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BURNING METAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The acrid smell of burning metal is mentioned, indicating the intense heat and effort during the dismantling process."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PORT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The port is the location where mysterious events have been occurring and where Rizwan works."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RIVAL SHIPBREAKER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A rival shipbreaker experienced sudden and inexplicable misfortune, which adds to Rizwan's suspicions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MYSTERIOUS EVENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mysterious events are occurring at the port, which Rizwan suspects are connected to the NovaTech device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUDDEN AND INEXPLICABLE MISFORTUNE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A rival shipbreaker experienced sudden and inexplicable misfortune, which adds to Rizwan's suspicions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0398</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;SERIES POWER STORAGE DUAL VOLTAGE POWER SUPPLY DEVICE&quot;" target="&quot;US 11142091&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device is protected by the patent US 11142091, which represents years of research and innovation."</data>
      <data key="d5">"legal protection, innovation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SERIES POWER STORAGE DUAL VOLTAGE POWER SUPPLY DEVICE&quot;" target="&quot;NOVATECH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"NovaTech produces the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device, indicated by the company logo on the device's casing."</data>
      <data key="d5">"production, branding"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SERIES POWER STORAGE DUAL VOLTAGE POWER SUPPLY DEVICE&quot;" target="&quot;CHITTAGONG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device is installed on the MV Serenity, which is located in the port of Chittagong, Bangladesh."</data>
      <data key="d5">"installation, location"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NOVATECH&quot;" target="&quot;RECLUSIVE BILLIONAIRE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Reclusive Billionaire requested the installation of a specialized power supply device produced by NovaTech on the MV Serenity, indicating a connection between the two parties."</data>
      <data key="d5">"request, technology procurement"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NOVATECH&quot;" target="&quot;RIZWAN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Rizwan suspects a connection between the NovaTech device and the mysterious events at the port, driven by the rival shipbreaker's misfortune."</data>
      <data key="d5">"suspicion, connection"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NOVATECH&quot;" target="&quot;PORT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">12.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The NovaTech device is suspected to be connected to the mysterious events at the port, raising Rizwan's suspicions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"device, events"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RIZWAN&quot;" target="&quot;MV SERENITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Rizwan is hired to dismantle the MV Serenity and salvage its components, including the Series Power Storage Dual Voltage Power Supply Device."</data>
      <data key="d5">"dismantling, salvage"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RIZWAN&quot;" target="&quot;PORT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Rizwan works at the port and notices the mysterious events there, fueling his suspicions about the NovaTech device."</data>
      <data key="d5">"workplace, observation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PORT&quot;" target="&quot;RIVAL SHIPBREAKER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The rival shipbreaker's misfortune occurs at the port and adds to Rizwan's growing suspicions about the NovaTech device."</data>
      <data key="d5">"misfortune, suspicion"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PORT&quot;" target="&quot;MYSTERIOUS EVENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">4.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Mysterious events are occurring at the port, which Rizwan suspects are connected to the NovaTech device."</data>
      <data key="d5">"events, connection"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RIVAL SHIPBREAKER&quot;" target="&quot;SUDDEN AND INEXPLICABLE MISFORTUNE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">5.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The rival shipbreaker experienced sudden and inexplicable misfortune, which adds to Rizwan's suspicions about the NovaTech device."</data>
      <data key="d5">"misfortune, suspicion"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0398</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
